          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "TL 10 NW                    ST MICHAEL      APPSPOND LANE                                             (east side)                                              POTTERS CROUCH 9/250                                       Appspond,(Nos 1 and 2) II House pair, formerly one long house or a cottage range.  C16 and C17, altered c.1950.  Timber frame, with plastered walls and plain tile roof.   To the front (E) side are continuous c.1950 additions in imitation timber frame with leaded casements;  2 storeys on N, single storey on S.  Rear elevation is 1 storey and attics with 3 C17/18 tile-hung dormers.  C19 and C20 glazing bar casements.  Interior is 4 bays.  The N bay is late C17;   slightly taller roof with large chimney stack at join.  Middle 2 bays are late C16 or early C17.  S bay probably C17. Listing NGR: TL1127405574"
    }
  ],
